sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Device Admin
    participant Device as Medical Device
    participant EST as EstController
    participant Orch as EnrollmentOrchestrator
    participant PKCS as PkcsService
    participant DB as Gateway Database
    participant Factory as CaConnectorFactory
    participant CA as Active CA Backend
    participant Notify as NotificationDispatcher

    Admin-->>Device: Provide one-time activation code
    Device->>Device: Generate private key
    Device->>Device: Build PKCS#10 CSR with subject CN
    Device->>EST: POST /.well-known/est/simpleenroll
    Note over Device,EST: Headers: X-Activation-Code, X-Device-Manufacturer, X-Device-Model, X-Device-Serial-Number

    EST->>DB: Resolve enabled EST profile by host and path
    DB-->>EST: EST profile id
    EST->>PKCS: Decode EST request body
    PKCS-->>EST: CSR bytes
    EST->>Orch: EnrollAsync(profileId, csr, activation metadata, clientIp)

    Orch->>DB: Load EST profile
    DB-->>Orch: Enabled profile
    Orch->>PKCS: ParsePkcs10(csr)
    PKCS-->>Orch: Parsed subject DN and SANs
    Orch->>DB: Find device by CSR subject CN
    DB-->>Orch: No active device yet
    Orch->>DB: Find pending device by activation-code hash
    DB-->>Orch: Pending device
    Orch->>Orch: Validate code exists, unused, unexpired, and serial/CN are present
    Orch->>DB: Ensure CSR CN is not bound to another device

    alt Activation request is invalid
        Orch->>DB: Insert rejected EnrollmentEvent
        Orch->>Notify: NotifyEnrollmentRejectedAsync
        Notify-->>Orch: Notification attempted if enabled
        Orch-->>EST: Failed(reason, 403)
        EST-->>Device: 403 JSON error
    else Activation request is valid
        Orch->>DB: Load active CA backend
        DB-->>Orch: Active enabled backend
        Orch->>PKCS: Validate CSR signature
        PKCS-->>Orch: Valid
        Orch->>DB: Insert pending EnrollmentEvent
        Orch->>Factory: CreateConnector(active backend)
        Factory-->>Orch: ICaConnector

        alt Self-signed backend
            Orch->>CA: IssueCertificateAsync(csr, profile)
            CA-->>Orch: Issued certificate and CA chain
        else ADCS backend
            Orch->>CA: Build SCEP PKCSReq and POST PKIOperation
            CA-->>Orch: Issued certificate
        else EJBCA backend
            Orch->>CA: POST pkcs10enroll
            CA-->>Orch: Issued certificate and optional chain
        else ACME backend
            Orch->>CA: Create order, satisfy challenge, finalize CSR
            CA-->>Orch: Issued certificate and chain
        end

        Orch->>DB: Store Certificate metadata
        Orch->>DB: Mark device Active and consume activation code
        Orch->>DB: Mark EnrollmentEvent Issued
        Orch->>PKCS: Encode certificate chain as PKCS#7 EST response
        PKCS-->>Orch: Base64 response body
        Orch-->>EST: Successful(PKCS#7 response)
        EST-->>Device: 200 application/pkcs7-mime
        Device->>Device: Install certificate with local private key
    end
